    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80033" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρι-ά</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρι-ιή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατήρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lineage, descent</i>, esp. <i>by the father's
			side</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγεν&lt;&gt;ηλόγησε τὴν
				π. τὴν Κύρου</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.75
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.143
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάτρα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>, <i>clan</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Michel</u>
				195.1
			</span></i> (Elis, V B.C.), <i><span class="en">
				995
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				26
			</span></i> (Delph., V B.C.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>family</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				12.3
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
				3.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in pl.,
				=
			<i>patrum officia,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cod.Just.
				1.5.14
			</span></i>.</div>
